{"title":"1966 AHSME Problems/Problem 27","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME_Problems/Problem_27&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>At his usual rate a man rows 15 miles downstream in five hours less time than it takes him to return. If he doubles his usual rate, the time downstream is only one hour less than the time upstream. In miles per hour, the rate of the stream's current is:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/9/5/d95a7a4601fdaa80e9c0c024aff1169eeb44e6e3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A) } 2 \\quad \\text{(B) } \\frac{5}{2} \\quad \\text{(C) } 3 \\quad \\text{(D) } \\frac{7}{2} \\quad \\text{(E) } 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"272\" height=\"37\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME_Problems/Problem_27&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let the speed of rowing in still water and water speed be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/3/b1364ae449158ece0dafafe0e35f7b77aa9878ce.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r, w$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"31\" height=\"13\" />. \n</p><p>Then: \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/7/9/0797a94fbf29683b44c345afe6bd2dfee842e0a7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{15}{r-w}-\\frac{15}{r+w}=5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"154\" height=\"40\" />.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/7/267ff1e193be74cac45d7ac366e092491e3de284.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{15}{2r-w}-\\frac{15}{2r+w}=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"172\" height=\"40\" />.\n</p><p>Solving (remember: both variables must be positive!), we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/8/f/38fbe89683ba24e958e5313d3b8e6406b2eb0345.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r=4, w=2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"99\" height=\"17\" />. Select <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/6/e/f6eb65962292d994ce2f9a8af63728883f256b18.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{A}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"27\" height=\"25\" />.\n</p><p>~hastapasta\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME_Problems/Problem_27&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME\" title=\"1966 AHSME\">1966 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1966 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1966 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1966\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME_Problems/Problem_26\" title=\"1966 AHSME Problems/Problem 26\">Problem 26</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME_Problems/Problem_28\" title=\"1966 AHSME Problems/Problem 28\">Problem 28</a></b>\